  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Liquid Ledger",
    "overview": "Penny is an Aurora Maximalist native Android finance interface: private money movement is viewed through a single luminous field of violet, magenta, and cyan rather than through a generic stack of equal cards. A cool white or violet-black ground keeps everyday ledger content calm while one dominant liquid balance lobe gives the home screen its unmistakable silhouette.\n\nThe system is expressive at the level of atmosphere, material, and motion, then disciplined at the level of reading and control. Glass surfaces are translucent but legible, type is crisp and Android-native, and semantic states remain clear in light, dark, and system-selected themes. Spring state selection and a traveling highlight make balance exploration feel physical without turning routine financial work into spectacle.",
